OL,3,GNEWSACurriculum changes encourage
OL,4,Achildren to speak up
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to give speaking and listening
OL,7,Fskills equal status to reading and
OL,8,Fwriting will help young people build
OL,9,Fconfidence and prepare for the future,
OL,10,Fan MP has said.
OL,12,FHull West and Haltemprice MP Emma
OL,13,FHardy, a former teacher, who has spent
OL,14,Fyears campaigning for better support
OL,15,Ffor spoken communication in education,
OL,16,Fwelcomed the revision to the national
OL,17,Fcurriculum.
OL,19,FShe said communication skills should be
OL,20,Faccessible to all, not just the
OL,21,Fprivileged.
