OL,3,GNEWSACurriculum changes encourage
OL,4,Achildren to speak up
OL,5,
OL,6,FCurrently, the English language GCSE
OL,7,Fincludes a compulsory spoken language
OL,8,Fcomponent that is graded separately,
OL,9,Fbut it does not contribute to the final
OL,10,Fgrade.
